      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_gravity",
      "narration": "Gravity pulls toward the planet's center, not just down, so the middle of each face would be a valley.",
      "on_screen_text": "Gravity points to the center",
      "highlight_words": [
        "center"
      ],
      "sfx": "riser",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s3",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_seas",
      "narration": "All the water would flow into those valleys: we'd have six round seas, one on each face.",
      "on_screen_text": "Six round seas",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Six"
      ],
      "sfx": "bubbles",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s4",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_air",
      "narration": "The air would do the same, and at the edges there would be almost nothing left to breathe.",
      "on_screen_text": "Edges with no air",
      "highlight_words": [
        "air"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s5",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_edge",
      "narration": "Walking toward an edge would mean climbing an ever steeper mountain, hundreds of kilometers high.",
      "on_screen_text": "It's all uphill",
      "highlight_words": [
        "uphill"
      ],
      "sfx": "whoosh",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s6",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_day",
      "narration": "And the Sun would pop up suddenly as each edge rolled past, with no long sunsets.",
      "on_screen_text": "Sudden sunrises",
      "highlight_words": [
        "Sudden"
      ],
      "sfx": "pop",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s7",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_round",
      "narration": "But a planet like that wouldn't last: the corners would weigh so much that the rock would slowly sink.",
      "on_screen_text": "It wouldn't last",
      "highlight_words": [
        "last"
      ],
      "sfx": "none",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
    {
      "id": "s8",
      "role": "development",
      "type": "scene3d",
      "model3d": "cub_round",
      "narration": "Over time it would turn into a sphere. That's why all planets are round.",
      "on_screen_text": "That's why they're round",
      "highlight_words": [
        "round"
      ],
      "sfx": "ding",
      "transition": "cut"
    },
